editor_description = "A pilgrim (Look and Feel, 'Characters': staff, shoulder bag, pilgrim badges on the hat). An undyed gown with a cord and beads, a grey cloak, a scrip at his hip, a felt hat with his badges, a staff in his right hand (tools/build/chr_pilgrim.py). Model is his body on its skeleton, with his clips (PersonModel). Feet at the origin, facing -Z. Head is his face (a FaceRig over the head model); Face is where the conversation camera looks. In the game both ride on the skeleton's head."
